# Claude Code workspace — developer-local permissions, prompts, and
# nested worktrees. Never belongs in the repo: it can leak local
# automation settings (e.g. permissive Bash allowlists) and bloats
# history with generated binaries from .claude/worktrees/.
/.claude/
